having, now and in the future?

565
00:28:05.410 --> 00:28:06.580
[GHIN gasps]

566
00:28:09.420 --> 00:28:10.790
[GHIN gulps]

567
00:28:18.640 --> 00:28:21.890
[GHIN sobbing]
I'm sorry...

568
00:28:21.890 --> 00:28:24.350
I'm sorry... Thank you so much...

569
00:28:24.350 --> 00:28:28.350
I thought it was over, I truly
thought I was going to die.

570
00:28:32.860 --> 00:28:34.190
[GHIN sobbing]
This food...

571
00:28:34.190 --> 00:28:35.530
