576
00:28:46.540 --> 00:28:49.540
I think I just found my cook!

577
00:28:50.250 --> 00:28:52.290
You're lucky he gave you some food!

578
00:28:52.290 --> 00:28:55.260
You weren't lookin' so
good there... [laughs]

